      "full_text": "Elisha Durham died at 4:45 o'clock Wednesday morning at the home of his nurse \n  at 1031 South Purdum street, Kokomo. He was taken to the nursing home two weeks \n  ago from his home in Greentown, suffering from a complication of diseases which \n  ended in his death.",
