      "full_text": "The deceased is survived by the following children: William Durham, Wesley \n  Durham, of Tipton county, Mrs. Will Pape, of Owen county, Mrs. Joe Moore, of \n  Elwood, Mrs. Lee Webb, of Madison county, Elisha Durham, of Howard county and \n  Mrs. Abe Collier, of this county.",
